<title>USA: PP&amp;L completes buying stake in Chilean co..</title>
<headline>PP&amp;L completes buying stake in Chilean co..</headline>
<dateline>ALLLENTOWN, Pa. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PP&amp;L Resources Inc said Wednesday its PMDC subsidiary completed the purchase of a 25.05 interest in Empresas Emel SA, a Chilean holding company of electricity companies, for $115 million.</p>
<p>The utility first announced the deal March 19.</p>
<p>PP&amp;L said it entered into a long-term shareholders agreement with Emel's principal shareholder Las Espigas Group whereby PMDC and Las Espigas will share control of the board and executive committees.</p>
<p>The company said Emel is the third-largest electricity distributor in Chile.</p>
</text>
